{"ID":"20240504154512-chvf90l","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154512-chvf90l","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154512-chvf90l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617154505-o3cc1y2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614163151-j10hffm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617154505-o3cc1y2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"017白青","updated":"20240617154505"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240617154505-o3cc1y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617154505-o3cc1y2","updated":"20240617154505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617154505-p5s8tji.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614163056-riim3i9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163056-riim3i9"}},{"ID":"20240614163304-stnve3b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163304-stnve3b","updated":"20240614163308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163304-85znkk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163304-85znkk1","updated":"20240614163304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163304-9u6g62t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163304-9u6g62t","updated":"20240614163304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气，令人吐，杀诸毒，三虫。久服通神明，轻身，延年不老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163304-7g2tmpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163304-7g2tmpq","updated":"20240614163304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》日：神农甘平，雷公酸无毒，生豫章，可消而为铜（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163304-xgixgks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163304-xgixgks","updated":"20240614163304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生豫章，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163304-2r126hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163304-2r126hk","updated":"20240614163304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《范子计然》云：白青，出巴郡。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163056-8hly8ko","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163056-8hly8ko"}},{"ID":"20240614163253-3lqwrqe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163253-3lqwrqe","updated":"20240614163258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163253-nm8o1a9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163253-nm8o1a9","updated":"20240614163253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸、咸，无毒．可消为铜剑，辟五兵．生豫章，采无时．"}]},{"ID":"20240614163253-zte69ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163253-zte69ss","updated":"20240614163316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶白青，味甘，平．主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气，令人吐，杀诸毒三虫．久服通神明，轻身，延年不老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163056-r4y9rfz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163056-r4y9rfz"}},{"ID":"20240614163209-hlxsfyf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163209-hlxsfyf","updated":"20240614163214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163209-44q2608","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163209-44q2608","updated":"20240614163209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘平。主明目。利九窍。耳聋。心下邪气令人吐。杀诸毒三虫。久服通神明。轻身延年不老。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163209-tjn7v4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163209-tjn7v4d","updated":"20240614163209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三十六水。鱼目萦中。挺英融铁。禀异吹铜。气宣管龠。毒制彭虫。静听熟视。条达均通。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163209-8dg3088","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163209-8dg3088","updated":"20240614163209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仙经。三十六水。方中时有。苏恭曰。形似鱼目。圆如铁珠。曹植赋。融铁挺英。刘禹锡文。禀异吹铜。傅子。心有管龠。宣室志。彭者三尸之姓。刘伶颂。静听不闻雷霆之声。熟视不见太山之形。阮籍论。阴阳调达均通。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163056-ftvgnjh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163056-ftvgnjh"}},{"ID":"20240614163201-q1fhau1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163201-q1fhau1","updated":"20240614163205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163201-3yvoaei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163201-3yvoaei","updated":"20240614163201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸、咸，平，无毒。主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气，令人吐，杀诸毒三虫。久服通神明，轻身延年不老。可消为铜剑，辟五兵。生豫章山谷，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163201-tfgx0k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163201-tfgx0k7","updated":"20240614163201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此医方不复用，市人亦无卖者，惟《仙经》卅六水方中时有须处。铜剑之法，具在《九元子术》中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163201-i314txa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163201-i314txa","updated":"20240614163201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕陶所云∶今空青，圆如铁珠，色白而腹不空者，是也。研之色白如碧，亦青时，亦用之，名鱼目青，以形似鱼目故也。今出简州、梓州者好。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163056-rdhne5r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163056-rdhne5r"}},{"ID":"20240614163057-83toway","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163057-83toway","updated":"20240614163101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163057-j15fnrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163057-j15fnrd","updated":"20240614163057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸咸，平，无毒。主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气。令人吐。杀诸毒三虫。久服通神明，轻身延年不老。可消为铜剑，辟五兵。生豫章山谷，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163102-mdcs5yd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163102-mdcs5yd"}},{"ID":"20240614163115-n2eqpy6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163115-n2eqpy6","updated":"20240614163120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163355-1qr8op7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163355-1qr8op7","updated":"20240614163355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸、咸，平，无毒。主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气，令人吐，杀诸毒，三虫。久服通神明，轻身，延年不老。可消为铜剑，辟五兵。生豫章山谷。采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163355-253fc8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163355-253fc8n","updated":"20240614163355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此医方不复用，市人亦无卖者，惟《仙经》三十六水方中时有须处。铜剑之法，具在九元子术中。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163115-tlnrn0l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163115-tlnrn0l"}},{"ID":"20240614163132-mxkzfxw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163132-mxkzfxw","updated":"20240614163144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163132-lbhnrfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163132-lbhnrfd","updated":"20240614163138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸、咸，平，无毒。主明目，利九窍，耳聋，心下邪气，令人吐，杀诸毒三虫。久服通神明，轻身，延年不老。可消为铜剑，辟五兵。生豫章山谷。采无时。陶隐居云∶此医方不复用，市人亦无卖者，唯《仙经》三十六水方中时有须处。铜剑之法，具在《九元子术》中。唐本注云∶陶所云，今空青，圆如铁珠，色白而腹不空者是也。研之色白如碧，亦谓之碧青，不入画用。无空青时，亦用之，名鱼目青，以形似鱼目故也。今出简州、梓州者好。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163133-1pdd69w","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163133-1pdd69w"}},{"ID":"20240614163150-s2w75y0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614163150-s2w75y0","updated":"20240614163155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白青《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614163150-kxpn9ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163150-kxpn9ri","updated":"20240614163150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生豫章山谷。今空青圆如铁珠，色白而腹不空者是也。研之色白而碧，亦谓之碧青，不入画用，无空青时亦用之。味甘、酸、咸，平，无毒。主心下邪气令人吐，杀诸毒三虫，利九窍，治耳聋，明目通神，轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240614163150-uxrv59a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614163150-uxrv59a"}},{"ID":"20240614163151-j10hffm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614163151-j10hffm"}}]}